DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
29134::$$$message_0209_0000_0000$$$::"Illya, want anything?"[lr]::
29135::$$$message_0209_0000_0001$$$::"Hmm...if you still have any tea, sure."::
29136::$$$message_0209_0001_0000$$$::We're watching TV together.[lr]::
29137::$$$message_0209_0001_0001$$$::The others have already finished taking baths and gone off to their rooms.[lr]::
29138::$$$message_0209_0001_0002$$$::Illya and I are the only ones in the living room at this hour. She's watching an uninteresting news program.::
29139::$$$message_0209_0002_0000$$$::"Is this interesting, Illya?"[lr]::
29140::$$$message_0209_0002_0001$$$::"Not really. But I need to know what's going on in the world, don't I?"[lr]::
29141::$$$message_0209_0002_0002$$$::"It's entertainment news, though... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ01a(中) textoff=0]Just a bunch of stuff that doesn't matter, like who married or divorced whom..."::
29142::$$$message_0209_0003_0000$$$::"Shirou? I'm done with the bath."[lr]::
29143::$$$message_0209_0003_0001$$$::Saber appears, freshly bathed.[lr]::
29144::$$$message_0209_0003_0002$$$::Oh, I guess they're all done. That makes me the last one left.::
29145::$$$message_0209_0004_0000$$$::"Was it a good bath, Saber?"[lr]::
29146::$$$message_0209_0004_0001$$$::"Yes."::
29147::$$$message_0209_0005_0000$$$::Saber adeptly braids her hair in front of me, returning to her usual appearance.[lr]::
29148::$$$message_0209_0005_0001$$$::I think she looks a little childish when her hair is down...::
29149::$$$message_0209_0006_0000$$$::"Okay. Why don't we take a bath together, Shirou?"[lr]::
29150::$$$message_0209_0006_0001$$$::"Yeah... Huh?"[lr]::
29151::$$$message_0209_0006_0002$$$::"What?"[lr]::
29152::$$$message_0209_0006_0003$$$::I freeze half a second after starting to get up.[lr]::
29153::$$$message_0209_0006_0004$$$::Illya...wants to take a bath together?::
29154::$$$message_0209_0007_0000$$$::"...What are you talking about, Illyasviel?"[lr]::
29155::$$$message_0209_0007_0001$$$::"I'm asking Shirou to take a bath with me.[lr]::
29156::$$$message_0209_0007_0002$$$::I know it could be taken the wrong way if I leave out the subject."[lr]::
29157::$$$message_0209_0007_0003$$$::"Wait, hold on. What's going on?"::
29158::$$$message_0209_0008_0000$$$::I check to see if Illya is joking.[lr]::
29159::$$$message_0209_0008_0001$$$::The idea of bathing with her sounds incredibly dangerous...::
29160::$$$message_0209_0009_0000$$$::"N..."[lr]::
29161::$$$message_0209_0009_0001$$$::"Not allowed![rf][lr]::
29162::$$$message_0209_0009_0002$$$::What are you thinking, Illyasviel!?"[lr]::
29163::$$$message_0209_0009_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ11a(中) textoff=0]Saber loses her temper before I can.::
29164::$$$message_0209_0010_0000$$$::"Heheeeh, you're insecure, are you?"[lr]::
29165::$$$message_0209_0010_0001$$$::"What are you implying?"[lr]::
29166::$$$message_0209_0010_0002$$$::"You're worried I'm going to do something weird with my big brother in the bath, right? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ10a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ10a(中) pos=l time=300 textoff=0]It's okay, I trust him."::
29167::$$$message_0209_0011_0000$$$::She laughs innocently.[lr]::
29168::$$$message_0209_0011_0001$$$::...I'm pretty sure she's laughing [font italic=true]at[font italic=false] Saber.::
29169::$$$message_0209_0012_0000$$$::"...No, Shirou wouldn't do something like that.[lr]::
29170::$$$message_0209_0012_0001$$$::He would not lose himself to untoward desires."[lr]::
29171::$$$message_0209_0012_0002$$$::"Yeah. Nothing happened when you took a bath with him, after all."::
29172::$$$message_0209_0013_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) pos=r textoff=0]What?[lr]::
29173::$$$message_0209_0013_0001$$$::H-how do you know that!?::
29174::$$$message_0209_0014_0000$$$::"Th-that was an accident, wasn't it, Shirou?"[lr]::
29175::$$$message_0209_0014_0001$$$::"An accident. Spontaneous troubles are what we call accidents."::
29176::$$$message_0209_0015_0000$$$::"But you wouldn't stay to warm up together if it was an accident, would you? You're more mature than me, so I'm sure nothing will happen if I do it.[cacheimage storage=イリヤ01f(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ01f(中) textoff=0] Right, Big Brother?"::
29177::$$$message_0209_0016_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服20d(中) textoff=0]She ignores Saber's flustered reaction and laughs at me.[lr]::
29178::$$$message_0209_0016_0001$$$::Still, I can't answer that question.::
29179::$$$message_0209_0017_0000$$$::"I-it can't happen, Illyasviel!"[lr]::
29180::$$$message_0209_0017_0001$$$::"Why not? Do you want to be the only one that got to bathe with Shirou alone that badly? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11c(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ11c(中) pos=l time=400 textoff=0]Saber, you naughty girl..."::
29181::$$$message_0209_0018_0000$$$::"That's not it at all! B-but men and women bathing together disrupts public morals, [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服06c腕a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服06c腕a(中) textoff=0]and that's not good!"::
29182::$$$message_0209_0019_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ11a(中) textoff=0]It's true that things would get crazy if we allowed mixed bathing. Even if we wouldn't have to worry about the order people use the bath anymore, my mental health couldn't take it.::
29183::$$$message_0209_0020_0000$$$::"Let's say you and I are fine. But what would he do if it was Rin or Sakura?"[lr]::
29184::$$$message_0209_0020_0001$$$::"What would you do, Shirou?"::
29185::$$$message_0209_0021_0000$$$::"Ugh..."[lr]::
29186::$$$message_0209_0021_0001$$$::I mean, you ask me, but...this is a situation where the man needs to keep his mouth shut and keep drinking tea. Honestly, I want to just roll on the floor all the way back to my bedroom.::
29187::$$$message_0209_0022_0000$$$::"See? Shirou also doesn't want mixed bathing."[lr]::
29188::$$$message_0209_0022_0001$$$::"You really think so? How can you tell unless you peek inside him?::
29189::$$$message_0209_0023_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ02b(中) textoff=0]Illya grins as she says something sinister.[lr]::
29190::$$$message_0209_0023_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服13c(中) textoff=0]What does she mean by "peek"? Just looking, right? I know that might not be a challenge for Illya, but I'd prefer it if she didn't.[lr]::
29191::$$$message_0209_0023_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ07b(中) textoff=0]When I shake my head, Illya glares at me unhappily.::
29192::$$$message_0209_0024_0000$$$::"[move time=120 path=(-50,26,255)(-50,3,255)(-50,29,255)(-50,5,255)(-50,32,255)(-50,0,255) storage=イリヤ03a(中) accel=0 textoff=0]Boo. No fair that only Saber gets to bathe with you. I want to go together, too!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
29193::$$$message_0209_0024_0001$$$::"No. In any case, mixed bathing is prohibited."[lr]::
29194::$$$message_0209_0024_0002$$$::"Hm, then what if I wear a swimsuit? That's okay, right?"::
29195::$$$message_0209_0025_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) textoff=0]...This is starting to turn into some hot springs comedy.[lr]::
29196::$$$message_0209_0025_0001$$$::However, forget swimsuits, you can't even wear bath towels when going into the water at a hot spring.[lr]::
29197::$$$message_0209_0025_0002$$$::I do remember bringing a towel into the bathtub when I was a kid... Wait, Illya's swimsuit?::
29198::$$$message_0209_0026_0000$$$::"When everyone's in swimsuits at the pool, that doesn't count as mixed bathing. So you can't complain about that, right?"[lr]::
29199::$$$message_0209_0026_0001$$$::"Going there, are you... That is true, but..."[lr]::
29200::$$$message_0209_0026_0002$$$::"And you got to go to the pool with Shirou, too. You've already got a double lead on me...."::
29201::$$$message_0209_0027_0000$$$::Illya seems to find that upsetting.[lr]::
29202::$$$message_0209_0027_0001$$$::...Illya had a swimsuit too, huh?::
29203::$$$message_0209_0028_0000$$$::"Illya, why don't we go to the pool, then?"[lr]::
29204::$$$message_0209_0028_0001$$$::"Really?"[lr]::
29205::$$$message_0209_0028_0002$$$::"You can't show off your swimsuit in the bathroom... It'd be a waste. I want to get a proper look at it by the pool."::
29206::$$$message_0209_0029_0000$$$::Yeah, it would be a waste in that cramped bathroom. Best to appreciate it with the summer vibes of the poolside.[lr]::
29207::$$$message_0209_0029_0001$$$::And even if we took a bath together, I'd like it to be in a more hot springs-y setting, like an open-air stone bath...[lr]::
29208::$$$message_0209_0029_0002$$$::Why Fuji-nee?::
29209::$$$message_0209_0030_0000$$$::"Then, do you want to go to the pool with me, Shirou?"[lr]::
29210::$$$message_0209_0030_0001$$$::"You mean Waku Waku Zabuun in Shinto?"[lr]::
29211::$$$message_0209_0030_0002$$$::"Is that what it was called? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06f(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ06f(中) pos=l time=300 textoff=0]Anyway, I'm going! Shirou, you are too, right?"::
29212::$$$message_0209_0031_0000$$$::"...Yeah. But when we go, let's invite everyone else, too. The more, the merrier."[lr]::
29213::$$$message_0209_0031_0001$$$::"Hmm... Then can I bring Leys and Sella?"::
29214::$$$message_0209_0032_0000$$$::"The maids? Wow..."[lr]::
29215::$$$message_0209_0032_0001$$$::Those two maids in swimsuits?[lr]::
29216::$$$message_0209_0032_0002$$$::[movefg opacity=255 left=400 top=106 time=800 accel=0 storage=リズ01b(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=160 left=530 top=104 time=1000 accel=0 storage=リズfd特殊01a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=137 top=97 time=800 accel=0 storage=セラ01a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=160 left=71 top=98 time=1000 accel=0 storage=セラfd特殊01a(遠) textoff=0]I've never even imagined how they might look before... In fact, I can't imagine them looking like anything [font italic=true]but[font italic=false] maids.::
29217::$$$message_0209_0033_0000$$$::"Oh, that's a good idea.[lr]::
29218::$$$message_0209_0033_0001$$$::That way I can come, too."[lr]::
29219::$$$message_0209_0033_0002$$$::"Heheheeeh, you're that worried about Shirou, huh?"[lr]::
29220::$$$message_0209_0033_0003$$$::"...It is my duty."::
29221::$$$message_0209_0034_0000$$$::"All right. So, I'm off to the bath..."[lr]::
29222::$$$message_0209_0034_0001$$$::This conversation went awfully off the rails, even though it was originally just about me taking a bath.[lr]::
29223::$$$message_0209_0034_0002$$$::...But I am looking forward to bringing Illya to the pool...::
29224::$$$message_0209_0035_0000$$$::"Yeah. So let's both go in, Shirou."[lr]::
29225::$$$message_0209_0035_0001$$$::"Wha... Illyasviel! Weren't you listening to a word we said!?"[lr]::
29226::$$$message_0209_0035_0002$$$::"Just because we decided to go to the pool together doesn't mean I can't bathe with Shirou."::
29227::$$$message_0209_0036_0000$$$::"..."[wvs][se storage=se075.wav][lr]::
29228::$$$message_0209_0036_0001$$$::[se storage=se073.wav]Seriously, if Illya goes into the bath with me, [se storage=se268.wav]my life will be at risk in more ways than one.[lr]::
29229::$$$message_0209_0036_0002$$$::I'd better [se storage=se057.wav]get in there [se storage=se065.wav]while Saber's still slowing her [se storage=se044.wav]down.::
929145::$$$message_9209_0004_0000$$$::"Was it a good bath, Saber?"[r]::

